# Radau-I Runge-Kutta Methods

## Radau IA

```julia; echo=false; results="raw"
for s in 2:3
    show(stdout, "text/markdown", Tableau(Symbol("RadauIA($s)"), 2s-1, radau_1_coefficients(symtype(), s), radau_1_weights(symtype(), s), radau_1_nodes(symtype(), s)))
end
```

## Radau IB

```julia; echo=false; results="raw"
for s in 2:3
    a = radau_1_coefficients(symtype(),s)
    b = radau_1_weights(symtype(),s)
    c = radau_1_nodes(symtype(), s)
    ā = symplectic_conjugate_coefficients(a,b)
    show(stdout, "text/markdown", Tableau(Symbol("RadauIB($s)"), 2s-1, ā, b, c))
end
```
